A lazy line continues a quoted term only as plain text

```
> - :: t
 - x
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <dl>
        <dt>t</dt>
      </dl>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<ul>
  <li>x</li>
</ul>
```

```
> - :: t
 1. x
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <dl>
        <dt>t</dt>
      </dl>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<ol>
  <li>x</li>
</ol>
```

```
> - :: t
  - x
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <dl>
        <dt>t</dt>
      </dl>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<ul>
  <li>x</li>
</ul>
```

