```
> - [ ] :: t
 - x
.
<blockquote>
  <ul class="task-list">
    <li><input type="checkbox" disabled> 
      <dl>
        <dt>t</dt>
      </dl>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<ul>
  <li>x</li>
</ul>
```

