```
r[^n]

- [^n]: :: t
  - x
.
<p>r<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li>x</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <dl>
        <dt>t</dt>
      </dl>
      <p><a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```

```
r[^n]

> [^n]: :: t
- x
.
<p>r<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<blockquote>

</blockquote>
<ul>
  <li>x</li>
</ul>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <dl>
        <dt>t</dt>
      </dl>
      <p><a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```

```
> :: t
 : d
.
<blockquote>
  <dl>
    <dt>t</dt>
  </dl>
</blockquote>
<p>: d</p>
```

